These studies deepen the common physics through substantial derivations, complete primary reading, independently checked computation and physical evidence. Choose investigations in every group required by [Whole books, graduate courses and a sustained thermal programme](../study/Whole-books-graduate-courses-and-a-sustained-thermal-programme.lingua#r_7NHTEAK764F0WSPPZNHZB7CJ1M), then join the result in [A complete thermal service from physics to continuing use](A-complete-thermal-service-from-physics-to-continuing-use.lingua#r_7J8HFJ2KFHGSRF5EB4JFNRZRB2). The physical and application studies extend the work toward demonstrated construction and continuing service.

